WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.301
-Jennifer, you --
you play a TV host

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:04.637
on "The Morning Show,"
but a lot of --

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.839
not a lot of people
actually know this.

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:10.577
You actually started out
as a local-news anchor.

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.946
-Mm. That's true.
That's true.

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:15.081
-That's right.
-We did that back in the --

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.515
back in the '90s.
-That's right.

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:18.617
You say "we" did that --
It's funny, because,

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:20.553
yeah, we did it.
Yeah.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.788
-We did it together.
-Yeah, together.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.089
-People don't know this.
They don't know.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.890
-No, we were co-anchors.

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.361
We were co-anchors at a station
in Great Falls, Montana.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.662
-That's right.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.331
-And this -- And the show
was called, "This Just In."

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:34.333
-Mm-hmm.
That's right!

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.268
-And this is where
we made our TV debut.

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:37.337
And it was --
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:39.305
-So much breaking news.
I remember this.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.840
It's the one thing
I always remember.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.508
Can I just tell you?
-Yeah.

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:44.244
Yeah, jog my memory.
-Well --

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:45.611
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:48.448
-What I remember is that,
there was so much breaking news

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:50.016
that often we wouldn't know
what the news was

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:52.585
until we were reading it,
live, off the teleprompter.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.186
-Yeah.
Oh! So stressful.

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:55.388
-Yeah. I know.
Well, guess what.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.823
-So stressful.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.823 --> 00:01:00.526
-I actually found
one of our old broadcasts.

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.495
-Oh, no.
-Yes.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.330
-God.
-So, here, for the first time

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.101
in decades, is Jennifer and I
in "This Just In."

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.702
Check it out.
-Amazing.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:12.939
-You're watching "This Just In,"
breaking news

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:14.974
with Great Falls' number-one
news team,

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:17.376
Jen Aniston and Jim Fallon.

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:18.811 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:20.246
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:24.250
-This just in -- it turns out
the Oscar Mayer Wienermobile

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.918
will not give you hot dogs

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:28.421
the way an ice-cream truck
gives you ice cream.

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.856
Trust me --
I found out the hard way.

00:01:30.856 --> 00:01:33.259
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.094
-This just in.
Breaking news --

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:41.067
a new study shows that an apple
a day can keep the doctor away,

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:44.603
but so can calling him
at 3:00 a.m. to say,

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:46.071
"Just thinkin' about ya."

00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:47.273
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.109 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:53.846
-Still developing, I don't
understand how microwaves work,

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:55.814
and I'm too afraid to ask.

00:01:55.814 --> 00:01:59.018
So I just heat up all my food
by leaving it in the sun.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:02.288
Takes hours, but it's worth it
for the soggy, cold lasagna

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:04.723
I shove down my throat
three times a day.

00:02:04.723 --> 00:02:05.925
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.161 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:09.895
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:11.464
-Sorry.
You keep doing this turn.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:12.899
Sorry.
[ Clears throat ]

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:15.635
This just in.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:19.004
-Oh, yeah!
-This just in --

00:02:19.004 --> 00:02:21.274
turns out there is something
in the rules

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:24.777
that say a dog
can't play basketball.

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:26.879
Air Bud has been forced
to give back

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:30.016
all nine
of his championship rings.

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:34.753
When reached for comment,
he reportedly said, "Oh, nuts."

00:02:34.753 --> 00:02:36.923
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:39.959
Stupid.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:42.795
-Moving on to weather.
[ Laughs ]

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:44.697
Moving --
-No.

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:46.866
-Moving on to weather.
Actually, you know what?

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:48.867
No, I don't want to move on
to the weather.

00:02:48.867 --> 00:02:50.837
I don't want to move on at all.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:53.106
I love you, Trish.
Please return my calls.

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:55.307
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.307 --> 00:02:59.244
I promise -- I promise to
stop screaming when we kiss.

00:02:59.244 --> 00:03:01.247
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:03.182 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:03.182 --> 00:03:05.451
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:10.156 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:12.525
-Weather warning.
-Oh, wow.

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:13.993
[ Laughter ]
-Weather warning.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:19.332
Winter hibernation season
is coming, which means I --

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:22.034
I have to move out of my cave
before the bears come back.

00:03:22.034 --> 00:03:23.502
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:23.502 --> 00:03:25.738 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:27.039
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.039 --> 00:03:30.443
-3-6-9, the goose drank wine.

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:33.112
Why local geese have been
breaking into people's homes

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:35.914
and drinking their pinot grigio.
More at 7:00.

00:03:35.914 --> 00:03:37.083
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:39.551
-Thanks for watching
"This Just In,"

00:03:39.551 --> 00:03:42.855
breaking news with Jen Aniston
and Jim Fallon.

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:44.690
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Those were the --

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:48.194
Those were the days when
we used to do that, right?

00:03:48.194 --> 00:03:50.897
-Those were the days, my friend.
-Look at us now, though.

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:53.032
My thanks to Jennifer Aniston.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:58.605
Season 2 of "The Morning Show"
is on Apple TV+ starting today.

